    "titleText": {
      "es": "Por un lado, nunca podrás convencer a tus padres de que se cambien. Por otro lado, ¡nunca podrás convencer a tus padres de que se cambien!",
      "en": "On one hand, you'll never be able to convince your parents to switch. On the other hand, you'll never be able to convince your parents to switch!",
      "noteEn": "The Spanish archive and official English title attributes are preserved exactly. The raster treats GOOGLE+ and both FACEBOOK labels as product names, while the localized CLIC remains a Spanish sound word. Vision omitted GOOGLE+, A, CLIC, and several punctuation-sensitive letters in the opening exchange."
