      "id": "word-unirte--join",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "unirte",
      "answerEn": "to join (addressing one familiar person)",
      "noteEn": "Unirte combines the dictionary form unir with te because the action is directed back to one familiar listener. A normally follows when the group, service, or activity being joined is named.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Puedes unirte al club mañana.",
        "en": "You can join the club tomorrow."
